  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jappo Millet Seed Production and marketing Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project consists of strengthening the production, storage and marketing capacity of millet for the GIE Jappo of Keur Moussa Frontire. The implementation of this GIE Jappo project will directly impact not only the 213 producers, but also indirectly the populations of the 12 polarized villages.</narrative>
  </description>
